{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>飲食作家兼KOL「玻璃朱」朱庭萱一向言論出位，感情生活亦曾掀起熱話。她過去曾自爆與黃宗澤（Bosco）拍拖五個月，稱被對方傷得很深，又嫌黃宗澤未能給予安全感，兩人最終分手收場，黃宗澤則受訪劃清界線。近日玻璃朱踏入52歲生日，她在Instagram分享一系列遊艇慶生照，其中舊愛黃宗澤的好兄弟林峯亦受邀上艇慶生，兩人交情極佳！</p><figure><img alt=\"有「玻璃朱」之稱的黃宗澤舊愛朱庭萱（Bonnie）。（IG：@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240722/892116855131475968782360.jpeg/1AxNPyVtKyVL0U6CHgT2jO_JDlBq_fljHrDF_h6wxf4\"/><figcaption>有「玻璃朱」之稱的黃宗澤舊愛朱庭萱（Bonnie）。（IG：@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「玻璃朱」朱庭萱到北京進修國際傳播。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250916/1044679001823907840702689.png/oBwehUVy8pjw2RPEB-2XPCD378D__PFmcd39-3Hd_fs\"/><figcaption>「玻璃朱」朱庭萱到北京進修國際傳播。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱庭萱目前是一名單親媽媽，獨力撫養兒子。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164602582899888128014826.jpeg/hdgSPCFjF-UdBSMtKEay65GDyiBGwk4-SPLYk0jy2JM\"/><figcaption>朱庭萱目前是一名單親媽媽，獨力撫養兒子。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><p>朱庭萱遊艇慶生 前度黃宗澤好兄弟林峯出席</p><p>上月24日是朱庭萱52歲生日，朱庭萱包了一艘遊艇與友人出海慶生。朱庭萱穿上白色背心短裙，長髮披肩，年過半百保養得宜。遊艇上擺滿粉紅色氣球，朱庭萱手持一個透明粉紅色氣球，少女心爆棚，又擺有兩個大蛋糕，儀式感十足！</p><p>除了一班女友人外，作為「契細佬」的林峯亦出席慶生派對，他與朱庭萱大方合照。朱庭萱為林峯契家姐，常跟林峯張馨月夫婦飯局，兩人私交深厚。朱庭萱發文感謝身邊人寵愛：「Still smiling from the boat party—thank you for making it so special for me and my friends 🩷🩷🙏🏻 And thanks for arranging again! 🙏🏻」。</p><figure><img alt=\"林峯出席朱庭萱遊艇慶生派對。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818488200826880596781.png/7fAtSukz8Fbh7p8-diD_ELo9-33bHOdcn_JW95_yVvc\"/><figcaption>林峯出席朱庭萱遊艇慶生派對。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱庭萱52歲生日。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818513530753024613704.png/JhBIzkbVf2VTUf_ymblF9yzvnCU5SKPR7l9Toe5fU6E\"/><figcaption>朱庭萱52歲生日。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大班友人為她慶祝。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818510967902208590823.png/wiakOv64gYhdjLO5iHnkfIdf-JCMOWe2ahFDo2oRQ6M\"/><figcaption>大班友人為她慶祝。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"保養極佳。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818508451188736640371.png/c4J2YSIslCqaKrHO3gaF8wICA7khWzrdWAB6QlgAekI\"/><figcaption>保養極佳。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"她分享合照。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818505494073344197642.png/Xd-nUeGzwFHr0BgjOrN-QChSL5FZ0JOUd2mkDXdppA0\"/><figcaption>她分享合照。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"她分享合照。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818502633426944947136.png/GRfS2LSk-VcksPSBMmj0Z_xZVhjXSegbZS_wkGUv8JA\"/><figcaption>她分享合照。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚！（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818509600690176480295.png/Uo8TC_Q8NHkVNs9xjCrs6ZyRc6KLirHfa4RbrGuEW6w\"/><figcaption>靚！（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好多合照。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818507016867840321685.png/jtTNzYYxMLXC65DtLX8FD-wxYm1Q_LPxu7RxnLu0cZw\"/><figcaption>好多合照。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好多合照。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818504454017024967540.png/yKjFCHgbZpdm-arWeQyeqfAUuBv4JGq8-kKOT_pCjk8\"/><figcaption>好多合照。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開心。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818502063132672013295.png/TQTt41cr7_V0JZlKAA0bU5C0jjMUl616vWcUlL1nFJQ\"/><figcaption>開心。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱庭萱多謝友人愛錫，連關楚耀都留言祝她生日快樂。（IG@chubonnie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183818498955022336824516.png/u57BLAeM4ZtSd-hnW8UcLE59jI0z5-J0hmeZoIZnmaA\"/><figcaption>朱庭萱多謝友人愛錫，連關楚耀都留言祝她生日快樂。（IG@chubonnie）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T14:20:45.857020+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":856,"images":14,"source":"HK01 